==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2~3.33 seconds<sup>60f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[The Thrillerz|Thrillerz]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*8 [[Coffin Zoge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*10 [[Mega Baa Baa]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*2 [[Dread Bore]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Cadaver Bear]] spawns after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
As it turns out, when the main threats are Zombies you can very easily rush a stage. Bring [[Hitman Cat]] for the Mega Baa Baas, a Wave Blocker like [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Supercat]] for the Doge Base, something for the Coffin Zoges like [[Cadaver BearCat]] and [[Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to beat down the base.

